---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import PhotoSlot from '../components/PhotoSlot.astro';
---

<Page title="About" description="The story of 44 Bar Ranch, a small family place in rural Texas.">
	<article class="about">
		<h1>About this place</h1>
		<p class="edit-note">
			[These highlighted lines are reminders. Replace each one with your own words, then delete
			this note.]
		</p>
		<div class="narrow">
			<p>
				44 Bar Ranch is a small family ranch and homestead in rural Texas. I raise chickens and
				turkeys, keep cattle, and share the place with ranch dogs who are convinced they are in
				charge.
			</p>
		</div>
		<PhotoSlot name="about" alt="44 Bar Ranch" />
		<div class="narrow">
			<p class="edit-note">[Add how you got started.]</p>
			<p class="edit-note">[Add who shares the place with you, if you want names here.]</p>
			<p>
				Most days are ordinary work that does not stay done. Eggs get gathered. Animals get
				looked after. A gate gets shut, and then it gets shut again. That is the job, and it is a
				good one.
			</p>
			<p class="edit-note">
				[Add anything else you want folks to know. What a normal day feels like, what you are
				proud of, or what you would rather leave off a website.]
			</p>
		</div>
		<p class="narrow"><a href="/about/dove-camp-2026/">Dove Camp 2026</a></p>
	</article>
</Page>

<style>
	.about {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}
	.about h1 {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.about .narrow p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
</style>
